			],
			"Message": "feat(Maintain): Enhance exclusion patterns for generated files in Rust and TypeScript formats\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "ada8a60cbba418af7af01adbdf95e9accc98ccd7"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T02:11:30Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Maintain): Resolve ProductFlavor into product.json identifiers\n\nThe previous overlay-merge pattern treated all product identity fields uniformly, but the new ProductFlavor build code must drive per-field identifier generation (applicationName, dataFolderName, urlProtocol, serverApplicationName, embedderIdentifier) with both a compact 10-char encoding and a human-readable long form. Replace the generic merge with direct property assignment so each identity field is computed from the flavor env vars.\n\nAdd ProductFlavor and ProductFlavorLong shell defaults and exports so the script remains self-contained when invoked standalone. Update the defaults source comment from .env.Land.Sample to .env.Land.\n\nproduct.json now carries flavor-scoped identifiers (e.g. fiddee-IWTNMMMMMM), enabling parallel installs of different build flavors without data-folder or URL-protocol collisions.",
			"SHA": "1f1e719b2005a8e65aa7c06e5064291f8b5cb55d"
		}
	],
